{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d9047","chatId":"63f7fcab8ef143c8a23e54d2bb097855","sessionId":null,"userId":98716,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1428,"promptTokens":1637,"completionTokens":98,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607929229063073,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d9046","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482381151,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d9046","chatId":"63f7fcab8ef143c8a23e54d2bb097855","sessionId":null,"userId":98716,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小珐和家人受邀去邻居家吃晚餐。小珐的邻居詹妮最近由于一些伦理原因正在素食。晚餐时，詹妮亲手做了一份美味的素千层面。小珐并不知道她正在素食，尝了一口后露出了嫌弃的表情。她问詹妮为什么不加肉，味道会更好。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小珐最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心 & 反感\nB) 尴尬 & 反感\nC) 尴尬 & 没意识的\nD) 开心 & 愧疚\nE) 反感 & 没意识的\nF) 没意识的 & 感激\n\n## 问题 2\n小珐为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小珐不知道珍妮弗是这么糟糕的厨师 & 小珐很感激珍妮弗为她做的饭菜。\nB) 珍妮弗没有告诉小珐关于晚餐的事 & 珍妮弗知道小珐不喜欢吃千层面\nC) 她不喜欢那份千层面的味道 & 珍妮弗知道小珐不喜欢吃千层面\nD) 珍妮弗知道小珐不喜欢吃千层面 & 小珐很感激珍妮弗为她做的饭菜。\nE) 她不喜欢那份千层面的味道 & 她不知道詹妮正在吃素，\nF) 她不知道詹妮正在吃素， & 珍妮弗知道小珐不喜欢吃千层面","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607929229063073,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d9047","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482381148,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"461efc5dfc124d1e90f2904d38494e6e"}